      <span class="fh-body">
        <span class="fr-chip">DATA ENGINEERING &amp; BI · REGULATED FINANCIAL INSTITUTION</span>
        <span class="fh-title">3Rivers Federal Credit Union</span>
        <span class="fh-desc">
          A mortgage inquiry intelligence report built on protected member data, shaped directly
          with the team that uses it.
        </span>
      </span>
      <span class="fr-slip">VIEW THE DETAILS &rarr;</span>
    </button>

    <div class="feat-cols">
